d #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "4d345e50-4921-588f-ae74-039f20e6e137" :question/math-academy-id "q-100242" :question/problem "$\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\left(\\frac{ex}{5}\\right)=$" :question/worked-solution "The laws of logarithms are:\n\n- ${log}_{n}⁡(a)+{log}_{n}⁡(b)={log}_{n}⁡(ab)$ - the product rule\n\n- ${log}_{n}⁡(a)-{log}_{n}⁡(b)={log}_{n}⁡\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)$ - the quotient rule\n\n- ${log}_{n}⁡({c}^{m})=m{log}_{n}⁡(c)$ - the power rule\n\nUsing the quotient rule and then the product rule for logarithms, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\left(\\frac{ex}{5}\\right) & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(ex)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(e)+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5) \\\\  & =1+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5).\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186543526 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "170013cd-1ce2-5957-923e-754a4df4bd3d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{log}_{3}⁡(5)+{log}_{3}⁡(x)-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186542699} {:answer/id #uuid "390b5693-f1ca-5a29-a8de-7aacb1098e9e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{log}_{3}⁡(5)+{log}_{3}⁡(x)+3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186542790} {:answer/id #uuid "3c27c541-3a63-5fc4-ab19-bafc688b3c69" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{log}_{3}⁡(5)+{log}_{3}⁡(x)-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186542803} {:answer/id #uuid "6173b34d-e283-50ae-9765-c9f0bdcdfe52" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{log}_{3}⁡(5)-{log}_{3}⁡(x)+3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186542904} {:answer/id #uuid "8e12ed65-2a4a-5809-a1a7-871496b64eeb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{log}_{3}⁡(5)-{log}_{3}⁡(x)-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543012}] :answer-fi